  "briefing": {
    "title": "AETHER'S VERDICT",
    "story": [
      "One stronghold. One man. Director Halex has pulled everything that still",
      "answers to him into the command bunker at the heart of the glass-flats — and",
      "he is still, even now, requesting orbital sterilisation of the whole continent.",
      "",
      "SERA VANE: \"This is the last door, Warden. Break it, and Aether Prime is",
      "whatever you made it back at the Vein. Corr and I hold the field. You end Halex.\"",
      "",
      "MARSHAL CORR: \"Whatever comes up out of the sand today — and something will —",
      "we finish the man first. Go.\""
    ],
    "objectives": [
      "End Director Halex — destroy the Directorate command bunker",
      "HARNESS: keep the Chorus leashed — hold the binding site as it wakes (75s)"
    ]
  },
  "debrief": {
    "win": [
      "Halex's command bunker folds, and the last order he ever gives goes unanswered.",
      "The war for Aether Prime is over. What the planet becomes now — a sealed grave",
      "kept sleeping, or a bound god held on human terms — is the verdict the Warden",
      "already handed down at the First Vein. Aether Prime will remember what you chose.",
      "VANE: \"It's done. Gods help us all — it's actually done.\""
    ],
    "lose": [
      "The last door holds. Halex finishes his transmission, and the sky above Aether",
      "Prime begins, very quietly, to burn."
    ]
  },
